/Title (Steele biomimetic knee mechanism)
/Subject (Two panels reproduced from Steele et al. Figure 6. Panel a is a sagittal cutaway of the biomimetic knee at full extension, showing the crossed four-bar linkage. Panel b is an exploded view of the knee's mechanical stop.)
/AltText (Two panels reproduced from Steele et al. Figure 6. Panel a is a sagittal cutaway of the biomimetic knee at full extension, showing the crossed four-bar linkage. Panel b is an exploded view of the knee's mechanical stop.)
>>
endobj
